{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish","id":818597,"title":"Who here would willing Accept the bargain of \"The Wish\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-28T11:19:37-08:00","id":818597,"title":"Who here would willing Accept the bargain of \"The Wish\"","content":"Id be sorely tempted, I have MS So have trouble walking or even typing this message... though I'd be nervous of what my master would subject me to when I was his.<br /> <br /> anyone else?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T12:12:41-08:00","id":818626,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish#post818597\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Id be sorely tempted, I have MS So have trouble walking or even typing this message... though I'd be nervous of what my master would subject me to when I was his.<br /> <br /> anyone else?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> thing is, unlike you, those who are usually offered it, don't know the full details of what the deal entails.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T12:27:32-08:00","id":818635,"title":"","content":"For me it would really depend on what I would need them for, and how badly I needed it. Better question would be if I could, theoretically, turn this Faustian bargin against the Daeva who offered it before time runs out. This would probably go very badly, but I feel like it could be an awesome story for a mortal character. You've got power, you're on the clock. Save the day, beat the bad guy, and get out of your own personal hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T19:29:16-08:00","id":818934,"title":"","content":"I would not. Instead, I would offer my soul for occult knowledge. I would rather learn all about the supernatural than be strong, fast, and pretty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T22:38:46-08:00","id":819005,"title":"","content":"Temporary power from a creature of mystical power beyond my understanding is not my deal. Trying to apprentice myself to them is more likely, whether or not I know they're a Vampire. Best result: end up a Ghoul or getting Embraced. Discovering there is a secret world beyond the veil of what we see day-to-day is basically what I live for anyway. Even if it's not entirely pleasant.<br /> <br /> I think only the desperate would go for it. Or people convinced with the Vampire's other abilities, like Majesty.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T23:43:52-08:00","id":819025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Arcanist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=818635#post818635\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For me it would really depend on what I would need them for, and how badly I needed it. Better question would be if I could, theoretically, turn this Faustian bargin against the Daeva who offered it before time runs out. This would probably go very badly, but I feel like it could be an awesome story for a mortal character. You've got power, you're on the clock. Save the day, beat the bad guy, and get out of your own personal hell.</div> </div> </div> </div>From the Evil Overlord List: &quot;I will not strike a bargain with a demonic being, then attempt to double cross it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2411-raistlin","name":"Raistlin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"713"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T04:18:51-08:00","id":819099,"title":"","content":"Well, to be as realistic as we can for a pretendy-fun-make-believe-game, its not like any of this is done in a vacuum. If a Daeva was using The Wish on me, I'd more than likely have been working with the vamp for a bit, chosen to become a long lasting servant/cultist and already under their Majesty's influence. Taken together, its more than likely an agreement that will work together long term, which likely would include all the long term things we've discussed.<br /> <br /> From the vampire's perspective, its a way of ensuring loyalty without using the Vinculum (and nasty addictions) or the Kiss of the Succubus. That said, I'm not sure if there's enough of a need for a mortal-only long term Enthralled power with the other two abilities. Especially when we've demonstrated that Enthralled can be broken.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T17:16:26-07:00","id":972220,"title":"","content":"know the threads old but was watching some anime and had an idea based on it.<br /> <br /> How heady do you think the feeling would be for a Despised Nerd, to now have degree of Majesty...<br /> <br /> in either high school or college.<br /> <br /> Especialy if he'd sucked at sports previously, ideas on how things would go.<br /> <br /> Would it make an especialy bad background for a Daeva's ghoul?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T23:53:51-07:00","id":972369,"title":"","content":"Wait, I'm confused. What's <i>&quot;The Wish&quot;</i> do for / to you?<br /> <br /> As a pragmatist, I'm not above the idea of a Faustian bargain, but I'd need to know more about the specifics before hand.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972220#post972220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">know the threads old but was watching some anime and had an idea based on it.<br /> <br /> How heady do you think the feeling would be for a Despised Nerd, to now have degree of Majesty...<br /> <br /> in either high school or college.<br /> <br /> Especialy if he'd sucked at sports previously, ideas on how things would go.<br /> <br /> Would it make an especialy bad background for a Daeva's ghoul?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Oh, you don't need majesty for that. You just need time and the shallowness of human society on your side.<br /> <br /> After school / college when the nerds have all the best jobs / tech and the Jocks who didn't earn scholarships are working for them, then we'll see who's popular!<br /> <br /> <br /> Unless you're talking about the socially awkward nerds... In which case, that's going to go <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><i>horrendously wrong</i></b></span> for those who mistreated them!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-19-2016, 03:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T00:55:03-07:00","id":972383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972369#post972369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, I'm confused. What's <i>&quot;The Wish&quot;</i> do for / to you?</div> </div> </div> </div><i>The Wish </i>is a Devotion on page 148.<br /> <br /> Three nights of power (specifics in the write-up) in exchange for the Persistent Enthralled Condition at the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T01:36:07-07:00","id":972399,"title":"","content":"I'm in camp no, 3 nights is very short term and getting that condition resolved is going to be hard and dangerous.<br /> That said if my respect for free will eroded away I would happily offer it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4714,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","user":"Live Bait","date":". 09-19-2016, 04:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T03:05:37-07:00","id":972424,"title":"","content":"Would need a seriously strong motivation to accept a deal like this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T05:33:45-07:00","id":972459,"title":"","content":"If I was the OP with MS I'd do the Wish, hell yeah, because the Vampire would have to find a way to cure the MS otherwise it would be very hard to exploit my services while I had MS, so to get maxium value any debilitating medical conditions would have to be cured. <br /> <br /> So there is a benifit beyond the 3 days. <br /> <br /> <br /> thing is, unlike you, those who are usually offered it, don't know the full details of what the deal entails. [/QUOTE]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T05:56:50-07:00","id":972467,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972383#post972383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>The Wish </i>is a Devotion on page 148.<br /> <br /> Three nights of power (specifics in the write-up) in exchange for the Persistent Enthralled Condition at the end.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Only three nights, then constant slavery?<br /> <br /> Gonna have to say nope. I don't trade freedom for <i>anything less that life long benefits.</i>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-19-2016, 09:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T08:52:52-07:00","id":972550,"title":"","content":"Yeah. I don't think The Wish is for the average person.<br /> <br /> The Wish is for people that are desperate to accomplish something at all costs. Saving a loved one. Revenge. Martyrdom. Avoiding death. That sort of thing.<br /> <br /> I can't fathom anyone without great need ever accepting it.<br /> <br /> And while the vampire doesn't have to give the full details, 'three nights of power' and 'you belong to me after' are <i>required disclosure</i> for the Devotion to work. They have to be informed of that much or it doesn't work. The vampire also can't use supernatural compulsion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1692,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","user":"Maina","date":".  grammar 09-19-2016, 11:53 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T08:00:49-07:00","id":973141,"title":"","content":"I have a bigger problem with it... Why would you learn it? As a player, why would you spend the experience on this, when you can as easily spend it on Retainers? Allies? Additional Majesty to get slaves, etc?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T08:12:01-07:00","id":973144,"title":"","content":"It can be fun being the demon that people sell their souls to just like some people like playing the people willing to sell their souls.<br /> <br /> Plus you buy this once, and you can have a lot of people who are effectively Retainers without actually having to buy Retainers.<br /> <br /> Plus, if you're smart, you can find someone who wants to use those three days for something that you also want. Maybe a rival's favorite Ghoul slept with this guy's girlfriend. He wants some vengeance. He's not thinking clearly, which isn't your problem, but when he's done? You have a weakened rival, a new thrall, and none of it can be traced back to you.<br /> <br /> It's definitely situational. Even more so than other Devotions which tend to be more situational than Disciplines in turn. But once you're thinking like a proper vampire, doing things the indirect way rather than the obvious way, it seems like it could be a really fun tool.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T09:14:41-07:00","id":973167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972550#post972550\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah. I don't think The Wish is for the average person.<br /> <br /> The Wish is for people that are desperate to accomplish something at all costs. Saving a loved one. Revenge. Martyrdom. Avoiding death. That sort of thing.<br /> <br /> I can't fathom anyone without great need ever accepting it.<br /> <br /> And while the vampire doesn't have to give the full details, 'three nights of power' and 'you belong to me after' are <i>required disclosure</i> for the Devotion to work. They have to be informed of that much or it doesn't work. The vampire also can't use supernatural compulsion.</div> </div> </div> </div> You only have three days to live and want to go out in style. Of course you don't tell the vampire that.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T19:40:06-07:00","id":973596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972369#post972369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Wait, I'm confused. What's <i>&quot;The Wish&quot;</i> do for / to you?<br /> <br /> As a pragmatist, I'm not above the idea of a Faustian bargain, but I'd need to know more about the specifics before hand.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Oh, you don't need majesty for that. You just need time and the shallowness of human society on your side.<br /> <br /> After school / college when the nerds have all the best jobs / tech and the Jocks who didn't earn scholarships are working for them, then we'll see who's popular!<br /> <br /> <br /> Unless you're talking about the socially awkward nerds... In which case, that's going to go <span style=\"font-size:18px\"><b><i>horrendously wrong</i></b></span> for those who mistreated them!</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes thats what I was thinking of.<br /> <br /> I know whats its like to be on the &quot;Out&quot; crowd, all too well<br /> <br /> Thinking of the things he might do while going on a power trip, making people make fools of themselves, wowing people with his sudden physical excellence with games of basketball, football, or the racing track<br /> <br /> Oh and Wooing targets of affectioin. of course..<br /> <br /> How dangerous to the Masquerade do you think the incident would be? Since that kind of upheaval would probaly draw a lot of attention, and in a high school a lot of kids would tell their parents...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T21:06:01-07:00","id":973631,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=973596#post973596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Yes thats what I was thinking of.<br /> <br /> I know whats its like to be on the &quot;Out&quot; crowd, all too well<br /> <br /> Thinking of the things he might do while going on a power trip, making people make fools of themselves, wowing people with his sudden physical excellence with games of basketball, football, or the racing track<br /> <br /> Oh and Wooing targets of affectioin. of course..<br /> <br /> How dangerous to the Masquerade do you think the incident would be? Since that kind of upheaval would probaly draw a lot of attention, and in a high school a lot of kids would tell their parents...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If his power boost only lasts a few days?<br /> <br /> Easy, just say he was using drugs at the time (performance / narcotics as needed). Get an asterisk next to his performance record.<br /> <br /> Power wears off, he comes back acting like a junkie in desperate need of his next fix. Probably gets kicked out of school. Masquerade upheld!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 09-21-2016, 12:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T09:28:24-07:00","id":973895,"title":"","content":"I must imagine the most palatable way to offer a deal that implies ownership would be in seemingly sexual or romantic terms. &quot;Be mine&quot; is a Valentine phrase often used in such context.<br /> <br /> Given what might <i>appear </i>to be a romantic offer from someone who by prerequisite has the ability to supernaturally appealing, and that many vampires might be tempted to choose attractive people to spend eternity with and thus giving vampires a disproportional chance to be mundanely attractive as well, I'd say the promiscuous, and the lonely would be high risk.<br /> <br /> Please note I am not implying using the supernatural appeal to get them to agree to the deal, but using it to get them very interested in a romantic relationship with the vampire and later offer the deal at the point the subject/victim is very tempted.<br /> <br /> Myself? Happily and monogamously married and way past the insecurities of my youth. (I have completely different insecurities at this stage of life, and they have nothing to do with the fleeting things of youth ie beauty, strength and health.) The Deal wouldn't appeal to me at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 09-21-2016, 12:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T10:28:26-07:00","id":973921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=973167#post973167\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You only have three days to live and want to go out in style. Of course you don't tell the vampire that.</div> </div> </div> </div>And some time after your death, the lingering taint from the Blood you drank to seal the agreement <i>just might</i> kick in, reanimating you as a very confused revenant or posthumous Embrace-ee with an unwitting and probably <i>very</i> cross sire...<br /> [evil giggling]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I've got a bit of a bad habit of extensively editing my posts after the fact. Please try and bear with me...<br /> In case you're comfortable being more friendly and casual about things, my name's Seren, or Es/Es for short. They/Them or Fae/Faer, please.","edited":{"userid":3946,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3946-sconce","user":"Sconce","date":". 09-21-2016, 02:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3946-sconce","name":"Sconce","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-21T16:27:08-07:00","id":974099,"title":"","content":"wanted to know on revenants,how invariably are they destroyed?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T05:03:42-07:00","id":974340,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=974099#post974099\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">wanted to know on revenants,how invariably are they destroyed?</div> </div> </div> </div>Depends on the city, in one they might be the only way to legally embrace and in another the vampire that made them might find himself on trial for letting them exist with his mistake.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T10:24:56-07:00","id":974498,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=973596#post973596\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><u>a lot of attention</u>, and <u>in</u> a <u>high school</u> a lot of kids would tell their parents...</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rick Sanchez</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I probably could turn myself into a teenager and hang out in the zit-covered, hormone-addled, <i>low</i>-<i>stakes</i> assworld that is high school.</div> </div> </div> </div><u>Underline emphasis</u> is mine.<br /> <br /> [sarcasm]Oh, upheaval of the social order of high school! However shall the adult world possibly cope!?&quot; [/sarcasm]<br /> <br /> Answer:<br /> Search #everyteenmovieever","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T12:48:39-07:00","id":975657,"title":"","content":"As someone in the know? I wouldn't except The Wish, because the drawbacks outweigh the benefits. Three nights of power is too little for being eternally enthralled to a vampire.<br /> <br /> As someone not in the know? Probably not. Being stronger and faster doesn't really interest me, and although majesty might be nice it wouldn't really interest me at all.<br /> <br /> I would likely agree to become a ghoul, as long as there's a specific agreement that stops me from serving 24/7. I'd be willing to serve, but the ability to mainly live my own life during the day in exchange for serving at night would be fine, I'd do daytime errands but I wouldn't be at my master's beck and call. The exchange is actually pretty decent here, although I start off weak I can become strong, I'm effectively immortal, and I have better health than I would ever have as a human. Running errands for my master, helping him with whatever he needs, and sleeping during the day sounds like a fine trade, heck I'll make sure the haven's clean and live there if that's the price.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T16:14:01-07:00","id":975727,"title":"","content":"'I'd be willing to serve'<br /> <br /> Would you not be worried about the power imbalance slowly making that consent more of a compulsion. As I understand it, a ghoul's liberty is their master's permissiveness. You could 'sign up' with certain rights but who protects them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2003-tabanese","name":"Tabanese","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2003_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"282"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T19:02:30-07:00","id":975760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tabanese</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=975727#post975727\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">'I'd be willing to serve'<br /> <br /> Would you not be worried about the power imbalance slowly making that consent more of a compulsion. As I understand it, a ghoul's liberty is their master's permissiveness. You could 'sign up' with certain rights but who protects them?</div> </div> </div> </div>It's certainly a problem, and I suspect that Vitae Addition does not work like normal addictions (which is annoying, as otherwise it could be mitigated by a functional life during the day). It's actually a much bigger problem than the Blood Bond, whixh while it makes you more favourable to your master does not rob you of free will and you can still refuse an order, although there will be less you consider worthwhile.<br /> <br /> Now, if the vampire uses dominate or majesty I'm not resisting anyway, so that doesn't matter. Yes, there's the possibility of using other disciplines, but at that point you're losing the benefits of a willing servant.<br /> <br /> Now, there is no garruntee of any rights established being protected, but there's the simple fact that what I'm essentially talking about is free time, which every ghoul is going to have due to there not being an infinite amount of work.<br /> <br /> I should specify that I expect to lose my nights essentially acting at my master's whim, as I worded my post poorly, I meant not being entirely free during the day (which is likely normal with most vampires). Being a ghoul is obviously inferior to being embraced, but to me immortality is worth the drawbacks of ghouldom. I should really find a better way to word all of this, but it's 3AM and I'm tired.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:blue\">Blue is sarcasm.</span><br /> <br /> If I suggestion I make contradicts in-setting metaphysics please ignore me, I probably brought in scientific ideas.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4507-twodsix","name":"TwoDSix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-24T19:57:43-07:00","id":975786,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TwoDSix</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=975760#post975760\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's certainly a problem, and I suspect that Vitae Addition does not work like normal addictions (which is annoying, as otherwise it could be mitigated by a functional life during the day). It's actually a much bigger problem than the Blood Bond, whixh while it makes you more favourable to your master does not rob you of free will and you can still refuse an order, although there will be less you consider worthwhile.<br /> <br /> Now, if the vampire uses dominate or majesty I'm not resisting anyway, so that doesn't matter. Yes, there's the possibility of using other disciplines, but at that point you're losing the benefits of a willing servant.<br /> <br /> Now, there is no garruntee of any rights established being protected, but there's the simple fact that what I'm essentially talking about is free time, which every ghoul is going to have due to there not being an infinite amount of work.<br /> <br /> I should specify that I expect to lose my nights essentially acting at my master's whim, as I worded my post poorly, I meant not being entirely free during the day (which is likely normal with most vampires). Being a ghoul is obviously inferior to being embraced, but to me immortality is worth the drawbacks of ghouldom. I should really find a better way to word all of this, but it's 3AM and I'm tired.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> As I said, I don't trade freedom for anything less than lifelong benefits. The three days of power granted by The Wish is off the table, but I might be willing to accept Ghouldom. You get access to vampire powers, while still being able to retain a mostly human lifestyle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T02:13:58-07:00","id":975887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=972383#post972383\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <i>The Wish </i>is a Devotion on page 148.<br /> <br /> Three nights of power (specifics in the write-up) in exchange for the Persistent Enthralled Condition at the end.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see the appeal. Three nights accomplishing those things you've really wanted to do, then a bullet to the head just before your time is up to cheat the devil. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Blaze of Glory!</b><br /> <br /> EDIT: I see Omegaphallic has already suggested that! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#D3D3D3\"><i>Fnord!</i></span>","edited":{"userid":11763,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11763-knasser","user":"knasser","date":". 09-25-2016, 05:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11763-knasser","name":"knasser","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11763_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T13:36:28-07:00","id":976074,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>knasser</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=975887#post975887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I can see the appeal. Three nights accomplishing those things you've really wanted to do, then a bullet to the head just before your time is up to cheat the devil. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <b>Blaze of Glory!</b><br /> <br /> EDIT: I see Omegaphallic has already suggested that! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div> There was one key difference, my idea had you already dying so you had nothing to lose, yours has you offing yourself so ypu end up losing everything.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T15:21:59-07:00","id":976118,"title":"","content":"Well if the Daeva knew you were dying ahead of time, they probably would not offer The Wish in the first place. You spend the next three days venting your frustrations upon the world, then you go off and die while the Daeva has to deal with the clean up?<br /> <br /> Yeah, no self respecting Daeva would ever, ever make that offer!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T17:29:58-07:00","id":976187,"title":"","content":"It occurs to me that the best use for the wish would be pre-embrace, you don't want a blood addict childe but you do want them loyal.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-25T19:01:50-07:00","id":976242,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Live Bait</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=976187#post976187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It occurs to me that the best use for the wish would be pre-embrace, you don't want a blood addict childe but you do want them loyal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually if you use that devotion on someone just prior to embracing them, you're pretty much guaranteed a vitae addicted childe since the devotion entails feeding the victim five vitae.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T02:31:49-07:00","id":976429,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tsusasi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/818597-who-here-would-willing-accept-the-bargain-of-the-wish?p=976242#post976242\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually if you use that devotion on someone just prior to embracing them, you're pretty much guaranteed a vitae addicted childe since the devotion entails feeding the victim five vitae.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok so give them a year to get it out of their system and use that time to prep them for embrace or rethink your plans, you're not likely to get permission to pick another if this doesn't work out so you want to do it right.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T03:09:39-07:00","id":976440,"title":"","content":"I think you're mixing up the vinculum duration (year and a day) with vitae addiction, which has no fixed duration. My point is, if you don't want dependent childer then you don't embrace your ghouls and blood addicted slaves. Since Daeva are the default megalomaniacs who need to be worshipped now, I'm pretty sure they consider their own sycophants ideal childer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5466-tsusasi","name":"tsusasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5466_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1028"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-26T03:44:12-07:00","id":976449,"title":"","content":"I was mixing 1e and 2e but good call. I don't agree that Deava are reliably megalomaniacs, I know it's one of the go to Deava character types but they won't all be adverse to putting in the effort to brake someone of their addiction to gain a childe who's loyalty won't waver after a year plus even if they do keep the addiction it's still more loyalty than you're guaranteed from a ghoul unless they resolve the condition in the first year.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-16T12:28:01-07:00","id":1219348,"title":"","content":"One thing I just thought of<br /> <br /> How much do you think the devotion fit's the Galloi?<br /> <br /> Can someone show me a 2nd edition write up for the Galloi bloodline?<br /> <br /> <br /> Since they create tribulation by giving someone what they wanted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https: